    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eChuck roast is the right cut and the whole cost of the dish.\u003c/strong\u003e It needs the pressure cooking to break down, so buy the cheap tough cut on purpose and shop the markdowns.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eGround fennel is the signature and it is a small jar.\u003c/strong\u003e It is the warm licorice note that says Kerala, and one jar covers many batches.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eOnions are the second component, not a garnish.\u003c/strong\u003e A serious amount of sliced onion cooked down dark is what the beef gets coated in, and onions are cheap by the bag.",
